{"ref":"BDB, פֶּ֫תֶן","hw":"פֶּ֫תֶן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫תֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:5\" href=\"/Psalms.58.5\">ψ 58:5</a> a venomous serpent, perhaps <strong>cobra (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">פתן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ben Sira 39:30\" href=\"/Ben_Sira.39.30\">Ecclus 39:30</a>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתְנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܦܰܬܳܢܳܐ</span>, whence perhaps Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَثَنٌ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—only poet.: pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ פְּתָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:33\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.33\">Dt 32:33</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמַת תַּנִּינִם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 20:16\" href=\"/Job.20.16\">Jb 20:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרוֹרַת פ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Job 20:14\" href=\"/Job.20.14\">14</a>; sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫תֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:13\" href=\"/Psalms.91.13\">ψ 91:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּנִּין</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ חֵרֵשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:5\" href=\"/Psalms.58.5\">58:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻר פָּ֑תֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.8\">Is 11:8</a>.","next":"BDB, מִפְתָּן²","prev":"BDB, פתן"}